<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=23"><img src="images/topics/look.gif" border="0" Alt="Look" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P>In&nbsp;an odd but interesting turn of events, a New Yorker caught Madonna in gridlock traffic in NYC. He was able to capture this picture of Madonna filming the streets of New York on her video camera. Here is the picture, which has been made&nbsp;into a close up by our friend Techjunkie and the second picture is the original. You can read the interesting tale of events here: <A href="http://toole.blogspot.com/">http://toole.blogspot.com/</A></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P><IMG height=236 src="http://img58.photobucket.com/albums/v178/Techjunkie/maybe.jpg" width=250 border=0><IMG height=218 src="http://www.madonnalicious.com/images/extra/2004/nyc_mike_24june_news.jpg" width=300 border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


