<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P><FONT face=Verdana><STRONG><FONT size=4><EM>Sex and the City</EM> star gets <I>Re-Invented</I> </FONT></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P><FONT face=Verdana><STRONG><FONT size=4>From: <A href="http://www.madonnalicious.com" target=_blank>www.madonnalicious.com</A><BR></P></FONT></STRONG></FONT>
<P><FONT face=verdana size=2><I><IMG src="http://www.myvideostore.com/content/people/pics/sarah_jessica_parker.jpg" align=left border=0>Sex and the City</I> star Sarah Jessica Parker was in the audience at the final show last night at Madison Square Garden in New York City. <BR>During <I>Deeper and Deeper</I> SJP ducked out to get a drink - she waited in line with everyone else and happily chatted to other Madonna fans waiting....but the line was so slow moving causing her to miss all of <I>Die Another Day</I>. <BR>By the time <I>Lament</I> started SJP had enough of waiting and exclaimed....'I am going back in...I am missing a lot!'....and promptly ran back to the show. </FONT></P>
<P><STRONG><FONT face=Verdana size=2>Thanks to Clare from the wonderful <EM>Madonnalicious.</EM></FONT></STRONG></P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


