<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=8"><img src="images/topics/interviste.gif" border="0" Alt="Interviews" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P>Eighties pop legend <STRONG>CYNDI LAUPER has attacked claims she is like MADONNA - insisting the pair couldn't be more different</STRONG>.</P>
<P>Both singers started out at the same time, before Madonna shot to international superstardom and Lauper failed to sustain her success.</P>
<P>But Lauper doesn't agree the pair are alike.</P>
<P>She says, <STRONG>"We're like apples and oranges.</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>"I like to watch her. I think some of her songs are really interesting." </STRONG></P><STRONG>25/06/2004 17:33</STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=2> <STRONG>Contactmusic</STRONG></FONT><BR>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


