<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P><FONT face=Verdana color=#999999 size=2><FONT color=#000000>Yesterday during &nbsp;an &nbsp;interview with <STRONG>French newspaper Liberation</STRONG>,</FONT><BR><BR>Director <STRONG>Milos Forman</STRONG> talked about the auditions to cast the dancers for the "<STRONG>Hair"</STRONG> movie, shot in 1979..</FONT></P>
<P><FONT face=Verdana color=#999999 size=2>He reveals that&nbsp;the production&nbsp;put an ad in the <STRONG>«Village Voice» of New York</STRONG>, saying that the first ones registered would have been the first to be auditioned.When he arrived on set the day of the auditions <STRONG>at 10 o'clock in the morning</STRONG>, there were already&nbsp;<STRONG>400 names</STRONG>.&nbsp; And <STRONG>the first&nbsp; one</STRONG> was that of <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>! He knew it&nbsp;only &nbsp;later,&nbsp;because his assistant&nbsp;had kept the list.&nbsp;<STRONG>&nbsp;Being first one, she arrived at 5 o'clock in the morning, that's why Milos didn't see and choose her.</STRONG></FONT></P>
</font></div>
