<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P><STRONG>My&nbsp;friend's Aunt who is a school teacher in Hoboken New Jersey met Madonna &amp; Guy Ritchie&nbsp;while Guy was filming a commercial about a corvette. Guy Ritchie and his crew set up their cameras in the school's playground and filmed the commercial from there.T<I>he art room and another teacher's room was used to house equipment, and she watched from the window of a classroom on the 2nd floor, before meeting the two of them; there was tight security.</I>&nbsp;Madonna was present at the shoot and she said that Madonna was somewhat&nbsp;friendly buy Guy was not too friendly; Madonna greeted&nbsp;&nbsp;some of the teachers with her&nbsp;arms folded across her chest and simply said with a smile. "Nice to meet you all."&nbsp;Madonna did not speak to any of the&nbsp;teachers only to say hello. Also, someone screamed, material girl to which Madonna reacted with a dirty look.&nbsp;&nbsp;She also said how beautiful Madonna&nbsp;looked up close. However, she wasn't too impressed with Guy's attitude.</STRONG>&nbsp;<STRONG>Rocco was also at the shoot but she did not see Lola.&nbsp; </STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>Also, this shoot will be featured on Entertainment Tonight Thurs. June 23. </STRONG></P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


